OL,3,AInterest rates held but Bank signals
OL,4,Arise if energy prices stay high
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bank also announced it was slowing
OL,7,Fits sales of UK government debt,
OL,8,Fprompting an easing in the UK's
OL,9,Flong-term borrowing costs.
